# Out of fakie: an FS 180 lands rolling fakie (the first air); popped fakie, a backside 180 (regular:
# turning right) is a Half Cab, a kickflip on the way a Fakie Kickflip; it lands forward.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold left 92..130
hold ollie 250..272
tap flip+left 276
hold right 280..318
run 520
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 180} within 160..240
expect event pop{fakie=true} within 273..273
expect event comboLanded{name=Fakie Kickflip + Half Cab} within 330..470
expect no event bail
